    "updated_at": "2026-06-04T19:32:17Z",
    "body": "I guess you clip to the content-box when is an image and to the padding-box when it's not? I'd prefer to standardize on this since `<input type=image>` usually does represent an image (that's the whole point).\r\n\r\nGecko used to not clip at all when not an image, and clip to the content-box when it is.",
