    "body": "Ah yeah thats what we are doing. I think i'd still prefer something like:\r\n\r\n```\r\ninput:not([type=range i], [type=checkbox i], [type=radio i]) {\r\n  overflow: clip !important;\r\n  overflow-clip-margin: padding-box !important;\r\n}\r\ninput[type=image i] {\r\n  overflow-clip-margin: content-box !important;\r\n}\r\n/* whatever other carveouts we need */\r\n```",
