    "body": ">  I'd rather have that change discussed separately?\r\n\r\nI'd somewhat prefer to change it all in one shot if we are going to start using keyword overflow-margin-clip.\r\n\r\n> Gecko and the spec have historically clipped to the border-box of buttons.\r\n\r\nThat doesn't seem to be the case from the testcase I provided above?\r\n\r\nFF Nightly:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"979\" height=\"174\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2026-06-04 at 12 54 12\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0398fde-096f-492a-a046-1e4ae1745dfb\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n",
