    "created_at": "2026-06-05T00:15:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-05T00:15:00Z",
    "body": "Curious, why? `<select>` defaults to `overflow: clip` (and `overflow-clip-margin: 0`, since it's the initial value), like `<button>`. It just doesn't enforce it via `!important` for legacy / compat / etc reasons...",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
