    "created_at": "2026-06-05T00:23:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-05T00:23:28Z",
    "body": "Err, scratch that, I totally mis-grepped our UA sheet...\r\n\r\n`<select>` in Gecko defaults to `overflow: clip`, but has an internal clip on top [here](https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/a88a631360c11753a059a9792693cbe12383404e/layout/style/res/forms.css#211,229), which is needed mostly so that text doesn't overlap the picker icon...\r\n\r\nIt seems Blink has `overflow: visible !important` on select but still clips... Ok, so agreed `<select>` is weird. It seems Blink clips even in `base` appearance mode, which seems... unfortunate?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
